<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Bank of Canada Valet API, series TB.CDN.90D.MID, Jun 1 to Oct 13, 2026; Income Tax Regulations s. 4301. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
