<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Bank of Canada Valet API, series BD.CDN.2YR.DQ.YLD, BD.CDN.5YR.DQ.YLD, BD.CDN.10YR.DQ.YLD and V39079, Mar 2 to Oct 13, 2026. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
