  1,
  'Bank of Canada Valet API, series BD.CDN.2YR.DQ.YLD, BD.CDN.5YR.DQ.YLD, BD.CDN.10YR.DQ.YLD, V39079 and TB.CDN.90D.MID, Mar 2 to Oct 13, 2026; Bank of Canada, 2026 schedule of policy interest rate announcements and Monetary Policy Reports; Continuum Economics, Canada September CPI preview, due Oct 19, 2026; Financial Post via Wealth Professional, Job losses push October Bank of Canada hike odds down to 25%, Oct 9, 2026; Ratehub.ca, best 5-year fixed mortgage rates, Oct 14, 2026; Wealth North, Canada 5-year bond yield and mortgage spread, Oct 2026; Schwab, Fed hikes in 12-0 vote, Sep 16, 2026; Reuters via Kitco, TSX futures rise as softer oil prices, bond yields lift risk appetite, Oct 6, 2026'
