<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Yahoo Finance, WTI front-month futures daily close (CL=F), Jul 1 to Oct 14, 2026; Deloitte price assumptions as reported by BNN Bloomberg, Oct 8, 2026. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
